'''Kaijin Doge''' (怪人わんこ, ''Kaijin Wanko'', '''Kaijin Doggy''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Kaijin Enemies|Kaijin]] variant of [[Doge]] introduced in [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary]] stages. It was added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Kaijin Doge
|image = E 750.png
|first appearance = [[Anniversary/13th Year#Ep. 1: Heroes of Justice!|Ep. 1: Heroes of Justice!]]
|money drop = 15¢ - 59¢
}}

==Enemy==
A conniving fiend with extremely low stats across the board, however, they boast the blazing speeds of [[Doge Dark]]. They attack almost as quickly as [[Metal Doge]] too, so watch out!

==Strategy==
Despite the strength magnifications given to it in more difficult stages, it remains pathetically weak in all encounters. Kaijin Doge drops almost no money too, so be sure to time any [[:Category:Cats with Money Up ability|Money Up cats]] around this enemy so as to not accidentally hit it.

