==Trivia==
*Kaijin Doge is actually the second standalone [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant of [[Doge]]. The first was the [[Media:Reddogeship.png|Red UFO Doge]] from [[Nyanko Defence Force]].
*Prior to [[Version 15.1 Update|Version 15.1]], Kaijin Doge's foreswing was 4f and their backswing was 14f, which was desynced from their biting animation which landed at 8f.

